# Retired temporary probe (superseded by genshare-receipt/v3)

`OXIDEX_PROBE_SILENCE` and this forward-port patch were retired by the
maintained `src/exiftool_tables/attribution.rs` seam.  The canonical
instrument is now `census.sh`; it builds one binary and uses
`OXIDEX_GENSHARE_SILENCE` for its paired control/probe executions.

This file is deliberately not applicable: applying a historical patch would
create a second, unreviewed attribution mechanism and invalidate the v3 raw
child transcript.  The maintained census runs six individual tokens and their
separately executed union against one binary.
